{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14218030","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14218030","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1421803001:1":{"text":"やあ、メイジ<male>さん</male><female>さん</female>！また会ったね！","source_cn":"魔法师<male>先生</male><female>小...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xD2D61F26338F91F7","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"やあ、メイジ<male>さん</male><female>さん</female>！また会ったね！","female":"やあ、メイジ<male>さん</male><female>さん</female>！また会ったね！","variant_male_record_index":"164268","variant_female_record_index":"164269","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1421803002:1":{"text":"まさか、こんな壮大な地下都市が広がってるなんてね！","source_cn":"难以想象，地底深处竟然有这样壮观的王城！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC02AD8CBA740ED45","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1421803003:1":{"text":"謎の地下王国に失われたドワーフの遺跡、そして飛び立つドラゴン――","source_cn":"神秘的地下王国，失落的矮人遗迹，由地底深处飞出的龙……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC04CAC1767C77327","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1421803004:1":{"text":"急いで来たつもりだったけど、先を越されたみたいだね。","source_cn":"我们本以为自己是最早动身的学者，却还是有不少同事抢在了...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA5DB4D6D8840CF64","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1421803005:1":{"text":"マーリン様に関する噂も、サロクディア中に広まっているんですよ！","source_cn":"不瞒您说，与梅林相关的传闻也在萨洛克兰满天飞呢！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xE85E25EF1443D233","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"マーリン様に関する噂も、サロクディア中に広まっているんですよ！","female":"マーリン様に関する噂も、サロクディア中に広まっているんですよ！","variant_male_record_index":"164273","variant_female_record_index":"164274","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1421803006:1":{"text":"ちょうどあなたに会えたことですし、噂が本当かどうか聞かせてくれませんか？","source_cn":"趁此机会我一定要问问您那些奇闻和壮举是不是真的！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x576E2B36CC85AD7F","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"ちょうどあなたに会えたことですし、噂が本当かどうか聞かせてくれませんか？","female":"ちょうどあなたに会えたことですし、噂が本当かどうか聞かせてくれませんか？","variant_male_record_index":"164275","variant_female_record_index":"164276","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1421803007:1":{"text":"メリッサ！気持ちは分かるけど、研究の優先順位を考えないと。","source_cn":"等等梅丽莎，我理解你的激动，但别忘记我们的研究优先级。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1082A3CE5C84EF24","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1421803008:1":{"text":"今は、『古代王国生態研究』が最優先だろう！","source_cn":"《古国生物群落考》大于一切！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9C8D7A7B9241EF35","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:10:1421803008":{"text":"今は、『古代王国生態研究』が最優先だろう！","source_cn":"《古国生物群落考》大于一切！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9C8D7A7B9241EF35","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1421803009:1":{"text":"私の方から説明を……こちらは研究テーマには事欠かないのですが、ガリが地下の特殊な生態系に興味があって。","source_cn":"让我来解释吧……因为这里能研究的课题实在太多了，伽利想...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7C3AD96EDE599AAE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1421803010:1":{"text":"というのも、フィンク先輩の大人気著書『古代王国生態研究』に影響を受けたからなのです。","source_cn":"这一想法得益于冬青学会的芬克前辈极为畅销的学术新著——...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x221CEBC756E71517","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1421803011:1":{"text":"最近、ガリはこの本に夢中……いえ、もはや取り憑かれているというか……","source_cn":"伽利最近很喜爱这本书，不，应该说是痴迷……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4245E77579871E13","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1421803012:1":{"text":"先輩の傑作に触発されて、地下生態をサロクディア研究の切り口にしようと思ってね！","source_cn":"芬克前辈的杰作启迪了我，把特殊的地底生态作为研究萨洛克...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0F44B66679C16E25","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1421803013:1":{"text":"僕ら考古学者は、人類だけじゃなくて、他の生命の歴史にも目を向けなきゃいけない。","source_cn":"身为考古学者，不仅要关心人类的历史，也要关心其他生命的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2D0E70886CE657C8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16: